OFFICE OF THE KAZEKAGE -- DISAPPEARANCE FILE: THE THIRD KAZEKAGE
Restricted. Kazekage Office authorization only.

The Third Kazekage was, by every account, the strongest shinobi Sunagakure ever
produced, master of the Iron Sand -- magnet-release control of ferrous
particles into weapons of any shape. His disappearance is the darkest unresolved
matter in village history.

Established facts:
- The Third vanished without warning and without body. For years his fate was
  unknown and the village left leaderless in his shadow.
- It is now established that he was abducted and killed by Sasori of the Red
  Sand, the defector, who rendered the corpse into a human puppet and thereby
  stole the iron-sand techniques for his own arsenal.

Standing objectives: recovery of the Third's remains should the opportunity
arise; continued sealing of iron-sand research; and vigilance against the
puppet arts turned traitor. Cross-reference the forbidden iron-sand archive.
Filed under permanent Kazekage seal.
